      "field": "abilities",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "Passive",
          "name": "Chain Reaction",
          "desc": "Basic Attack and skill hits inflict stacks on the opponent, dealing extra truedamage at max stacks. Extra Attack Speed bonuses increase the number ofbullets fired by Skill 1 and 3."
        },
        {
          "type": "Skill 1",
          "name": "Resplendent Revolver",
          "desc": "Fires in the target direction for a period of time and gains increasedMovement Speed while firing."
        },
        {
          "type": "Skill 2",
          "name": "Roaming Gun",
          "desc": "Teleports in the target direction.Passive: Gains Attack and Movement Speed when a nearby enemy hero is within range."
        },
        {
          "type": "Ultimate",
          "name": "Fevered Barrage",
          "desc": "Shifts in the target direction and deals damage over time to nearby enemies within range."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "source": "HOKFIRE",
      "url": "https://www.hokfire.com/",
      "field": "guide",
      "content": {
        "pros": [
          "Shreds through tanks",
          "High mobility and self-peel",
          "Powerful teamfight AOE Ultimate"
        ],
        "cons": [
          "Weak early game",
          "High-risk Ultimate",
          "Skill-dependent kit"
        ],
        "gameplay_tips": "## Early Game\nMarco Polo's early game is very weak. You want to focus on farming and use Skill 1 Energy Bullets to last-hit minions and poke enemies from range. Save your Skill 2 Quick Step dash for escaping jungle ganks and dodging enemy skill shots. You should only look to trade or go all in when your passive is close so you can deal true damage to the enemy.\n\n## Teamfights\nIn teamfights, you want to stand behind your front line and use Skill 1 Energy Bullets to stack your passive. Once you've built up your passive you can look to dash in to deal true damage. Keep moving whilst using Skill 1 to kite and dodge skillshots.\n\n## Tips & Tricks\nDo not touch the left stick when using your Ultimate, or you'll cancel it\nYou can use Purify whilst in your Ultimate to stop any crowd control\n"
      }
    },
    {
      "source": "Kurohiko",
      "url": "https://hok.kurohiko.id/",
      "field": "tactical_tips",
      "content": "1) Abis Marco Polo nyerang beberapa kali, jaga jarak biar dia gak burst pakai true damage. 2) Pas ult dia gak bisa gerak walaupun ada dash di awal. Simpen skill buat control, atau nyebar buat ngindarin burst-nya."
    },
